@startuml

title User Registration with SMS OTP Verification

actor User
participant Frontend
participant "Spring Boot API" as API
participant Keycloak
participant Twilio

User -> Frontend : Fill Registration Form\n(Name, Email, Mobile, Password)
Frontend -> API : POST /register

API -> Keycloak : Create User\nmobileNumber\nmobileVerified=false\nenabled=false
Keycloak --> API : User Created

API -> Twilio : Send OTP(mobileNumber)
Twilio --> API : OTP Sent

API --> Frontend : Registration Pending\nOTP Verification Required

Frontend --> User : Display OTP Screen

User -> Frontend : Enter OTP

Frontend -> API : POST /verify-otp

API -> Twilio : Validate OTP
Twilio --> API : OTP Valid

API -> Keycloak : Update User\nmobileVerified=true\nenabled=true
Keycloak --> API : User Updated

API --> Frontend : Registration Complete

Frontend --> User : Account Successfully Verified

@enduml